<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>What Is Taken, Will Never Be Lost</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Boston Manor</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Sundiver</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">3DYsXpkGQJqzPeSxf5iRuv</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1">{"c":[{"tx":"作词: "},{"tx":"Henry Cox"}]}</p><p ttm:agent="v1">{"c":[{"tx":"作曲: "},{"tx":"Henry Cox"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Ash Wilson"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Jordan Pugh"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Mike Cunniff"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Dan Cunniff"}]}</p><p ttm:agent="v1">It’s always cold when I come here</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Somebody wants to send me away</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And the light is always on</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Got years in a box in the bedroom</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I can’t reach, I tried to give it away</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I wish they’d turn it off</p><p ttm:agent="v1">What is taken will never be lost</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Because you’re finding little pieces in the dark</p><p ttm:agent="v1">What is taken will never be lost</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Because you’re finding little pieces in the dark</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Empty walls and corridors</p><p ttm:agent="v1">They should complain, I took a fall.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Never the daytime, never the night</p><p ttm:agent="v1">When you open your eyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Wish they’d read you your rites.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">What is taken will never be lost</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Because you’re finding little pieces in the dark</p><p ttm:agent="v1">What is taken will never be lost</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Because you’re finding little pieces in the dark</p></div></body></tt>